 ## Known limitations
 
 - The Google Calendar adapter is implemented but needs the entrant's Google OAuth client ID and consent setup. Real Calendar authorization and writes have not been verified in this workspace.
+- The real Open-Meteo read was verified on 2026-10-04. The app checks on startup and manual refresh; it has no background monitoring or push notifications.
